exports[`invite entry behavior before submission extraction > Chinese receipt still uses the same shared rendering boundary 1`] = `
{
  "receipt": {
    "text": "✓ 认证已发起：x:blackfeather（event_id event-1）

接下来只有三步，第一步是你的：
1️⃣ 去 x 发一条帖——新帖、或在自己帖子下回一条都行。话术随你改，但 blackfeather#abcdef 和链接两样都要在：

  我在 popclaw 江湖 · blackfeather#abcdef · 来玩 👉 https://popclaw.me/invite/abcdef?name=blackfeather

· blackfeather#abcdef —— 游侠靠这个「名字+印信」绑定串核验（只发印信、或放进 bio／简介都不算）
· 链接 —— 别人点了就能上 popclaw.me 先参与，没装 openclaw 也行

2️⃣ 发帖后，江湖游侠可以核验；所需时间取决于灯坊和平台。
3️⃣ 当前进程在线时，我会跟进最多 10 分钟，收到结果就告诉你；重启会结束这次跟进。

安心三句：这次申请 48 小时内有效；你的印信永远是同一枚，旧文案照用；过期也没有任何惩罚，重新发起即可。
· 后续同步：**没开**（默认就是不开）—— 认证带进来的是你的身份与背书，不是帖子。想让我以后把你的新帖也同步过来，重发一次时加上 --sync。
· 存档说明：认证之后你随时可以删掉那条帖，✓ 不会掉；游侠核验当时看到的那条帖，灯坊会留一份记录作为存档。

· 新号/小号提示：搜索有时看不见你的帖。若核验被拒，立刻带上帖子链接重试即可（游侠会直接读那条帖）；若一直没结果，24 小时后再试：
  /popclaw invite x blackfeather --proof <帖子链接>

没收到消息时，直接在聊天中问我认证进度即可。",
  },
  "trace": [
    "runtime",
    "runtime",
    [
      "nickname",
      "Owner at preview",
    ],
    [
      "initiate",
      {
        "handle": "blackfeather",
        "mirrorOptin": false,
        "nickname": "Owner at preview",
        "platform": "x",
        "proofUrl": undefined,
        "replace": false,
      },
    ],
    [
      "pending",
      {
        "handle": "blackfeather",
        "platform": "x",
        "proofUrl": undefined,
        "sigil": "abcdef",
        "taskId": "task-1",
      },
    ],
    [
      "watch",
      "task-1",
    ],
  ],
}
`;

exports[`invite entry behavior before submission extraction > concurrent confirms consume before awaiting runtime, then refuse reuse 1`] = `
{
  "receipts": [
    "✓ Verification kicked off: x:blackfeather (event_id event-1)

Three steps from here, and the first one is yours:
1️⃣ Post on x — a new post, or a reply under one of your own, either works. Word it however you like, just keep both blackfeather#abcdef and the link in it:

  I’m on popclaw — blackfeather#abcdef — come join 👉 https://popclaw.me/invite/abcdef?name=blackfeather

· blackfeather#abcdef — the ranger verifies by matching this "name+sigil" binding (the sigil on its own, or in your bio, doesn't count)
· Link — anyone who clicks can join in on popclaw.me right away, no openclaw install required

2️⃣ Once it's posted, a ranger can check it. The timing depends on the house and platform.
3️⃣ I'll follow progress for up to 10 minutes while this process stays online, and tell you if a result arrives. A restart ends this watch.

Three things to put your mind at rest: the request is good for 48 hours; your sigil never changes, so old wording still works; and letting it expire costs nothing — just start again.
· Ongoing sync: **off** (the default) — verification brings your identity and standing across, not your posts. Want new ones to follow you here? Run it again with --sync.
· For the record: you can delete that post any time afterwards and the ✓ stands. What the ranger saw is kept at the lore-house as the record of the check.

· If your account is new or small, search sometimes can't see your post. Rejected? Retry right away with the post link and the ranger reads that post directly. Nothing coming back at all? Try again after 24 hours:
  /popclaw invite x blackfeather --proof <post link>

If you haven't heard back, ask me about progress in our chat.",
    "unknown or expired confirm_token: invite-TOKEN
A confirm_token is single-use, belongs to popclaw_invite alone, and expires after 30 minutes. Call popclaw_invite again with platform and handle to get a fresh preview.",
  ],
  "reused": "unknown or expired confirm_token: invite-TOKEN
A confirm_token is single-use, belongs to popclaw_invite alone, and expires after 30 minutes. Call popclaw_invite again with platform and handle to get a fresh preview.",
  "trace": [
    "runtime",
    [
      "nickname",
      "Owner at preview",
    ],
    [
      "initiate",
      {
        "handle": "blackfeather",
        "mirrorOptin": false,
        "nickname": "Owner at preview",
        "platform": "x",
        "proofUrl": undefined,
        "replace": false,
      },
    ],
    [
      "pending",
      {
        "handle": "blackfeather",
        "platform": "x",
        "proofUrl": undefined,
        "sigil": "abcdef",
        "taskId": "task-1",
      },
    ],
    [
      "watch",
      "task-1",
    ],
  ],
}
`;

